+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only */
+/*
+ * MINIMAL COMPATIBILITY HEADER - NOT A VENDOR-EQUIVALENT HEADER
+ *
+ * Round2 KGSL+SDE 6.18 port, sde-hw-encoder-dp agent.
+ *
+ * The 6.18 prepared kernel has no <linux/msm_ext_display.h> and no
